<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet to meet on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet to meet on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian cabinet will meet on Thursday at 1530 GMT and will discuss European issues, an official statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini would make a report to the cabinet. Other routine items on the agenda included labour, health and communications legislation.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
